      "expected_lines": 31,
      "presence_bits": "",
      "cues": {
        "0": "All crew: this ship will now make an\nemergency landing on planet Machia.",
        "1": "Everyone, brace for impact.",
        "2": "Sub-drives to maximum output.",
        "3": "Attitude control! Set the atmospheric\nentry angle!",
        "4": "The angle's too steep! Correct it!",
        "5": "",
        "6": "Not enough power! We can't hold attitude\nand angle much longer...!",
        "7": "Sub-drive output dropping further!",
        "8": "At this speed, even if we clear the\natmosphere, we'll slam into the ground!",
        "9": "Ngh... Is there nothing we can do...?",
        "10": "Slow us down!",
        "11": "There's no other choice...!",
        "12": "Over there!",
        "13": "Vice Captain Raven, what are you doing?!",
        "14": "Divert all energy to the bow shields!",
        "15": "Just for a moment... hold together...",
        "16": "Impact incoming!!",
        "17": "Is everyone all right?",
        "18": "I wouldn't call this \"all right\"...\nnot in this situation.",
        "19": "Engine room reports the photon drive\nhas stopped completely.",
        "20": "What is going on...? Speed up the investigation.",
        "21": "I'll take charge of finding the cause.",
        "22": "If the drive isn't restored,\nthe whole ship will shut down.",
        "23": "But we must prepare for the worst.",
        "24": "Yes. To keep everyone alive, we'll have to\ndeal with this planet for a while.",
        "25": "Kisara, gather everyone who can move.",
        "26": "Our battle with this planet begins now!",
        "27": "Yes, sir! All hands: combat units,\nprepare to sortie!",
        "28": "Beginning survey and patrol\nof the area around the ship!",
        "29": "",
        "30": ""
